                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">The ShapeDiver Legacy Display component creates PBR materials in the online viewer and allows to define various texture maps (color, metalness, roughness, normal, opacity). In most use cases, it is superseded by the more recent glTF 2.0 Display and Material components, but is still supported for backwards compatibility and because of slight differences and texture and geometry handling which might be relevant in some cases.</item>
                  </items>
